  "title": "FDA Recalls Vegan Cheddar Puffs Over Undeclared Milk Allergy Risk",
  "summary": "The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) has announced a recall involving Frankie’s Organic Plant Based Vegan Cheddar Puffs after the company discovered that the snack may contain undeclared milk. The recall affects a limited quantity of the product distributed in Washington, Florida, and South Carolina. According to an FDA public health alert issued on Aug. 12, 2026, Frankie’s Organic of Quebec, Canada, withdrew 94 cases of its 4-ounce bags of Frankie’s Organic Plant-Based Vegan Cheddar Puf",
